            "id": 144706,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib der Waffenname Nachdruck, indem du die öffnenden und schließenden Hervorhebungstags hinzufügst.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just looted the \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Crystal Sword\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" from the chest.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, gefolgt von <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144707,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge einen Zeilenumbruch zwischen <em>PlayerOne</em> und <em>Score: 9000</em> hinzu, sodass <em>PlayerOne</em> in einer Zeile und <em>Score: 9000</em> darunter steht.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/br&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" PlayerOne \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Score: 9000 \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144708,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib den Wörtern im zweiten Satz Nachdruck.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My party gets nervous when the boss music starts. \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"I guess it's time\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" to dodge-roll a lot.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, gefolgt von <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
